          "status": "needs-review",
          "text": "Description: A person reports by phone observing for thirty seconds a star growing in size, followed by the silent passage at a steady speed of three bright points forming a triangle. The phenomenon quickly disappeared in the direction of Figeac. The observation of a \"star\" growing (approaching) and three bright points in a triangle could correspond to an airplane (airway), but despite repeated requests from GEIPAN, no information (nor questionnaire, nor police report) is provided by the witness. Any investigation is impossible.",
